{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"user-1","name":"プロデューサー","text":"──……これは、なんだ？","trans":"——……这是什么？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901018680010","name":"雛菜","text":"ん～？\r\nチョコバイキング～！","trans":"嗯～？\n巧克力自助餐～！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901018680020","name":"雛菜","text":"雛菜食べたいやついっぱいあったから\r\n全部並べてみました～","trans":"雛菜想吃的东西太多了\n就全都摆出来了～","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-4","name":"プロデューサー","text":"うん、そうか\r\nでも、なんで事務所で……","trans":"嗯，这样啊\n可是，为什么在事务所……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901018680030","name":"雛菜","text":"へ～？\r\nだって、プロデューサーもするでしょ？","trans":"诶～？\n因为，制作人也要一起的吧？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901018680040","name":"雛菜","text":"チョコバイキング！","trans":"巧克力自助餐！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-7","name":"プロデューサー","text":"お、俺もいいのか……？","trans":"我、我也可以吗……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901018680050","name":"雛菜","text":"あは～、いいよ～！","trans":"啊哈～，可以哦～！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901018680060","name":"雛菜","text":"だって、バレンタインだもんね～","trans":"因为，今天是情人节嘛～","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}